Files derived from AprilRobotics apriltag
-----------------------------------------

The following files of this project are derived from AprilRobotics apriltag v3.4.5 (https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag),
which is licensed under the BSD 2-Clause licence reproduced below, Copyright (C) 2013-2016 The Regents of The
University of Michigan:

- apriltags_vulkan/library/src/families/*.cpp (tag16h5, tag25h9, tag36h11, tagCircle21h7, tagCircle49h12,
  tagStandard41h12, tagStandard52h13, tagCustom48h12): the family code tables, generated by
  apriltags_vulkan/tools/gen_families.py from upstream's tag family sources.
- apriltags_vulkan/library/src/OwnDecode.h and OwnDecode.cpp: ported from upstream's apriltag.c (quad_decode,
  quad_decode_index, quad_update_homographies, reconcile_detections), common/g2d.c, apriltag_math.h and
  common/homography.h.

This project does not link, fetch or install the upstream library. Upstream is fetched only when the optional
reference validation tools are built (-DVKAPRILTAG_UPSTREAM_VALIDATION=ON); those tools, the patches that expose
upstream's decode steps for recording the test vectors and the recorded vectors (tests/own_decode_vectors.bin) are
not part of the library or of the installed packages.

